    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to present for sale 27 Cabra Park, a 3-storey red-brick house in 3 self-contained units located close to Phibsboro Village.\n\nThe property, with increase in rent pending, will have an annual income of c. 62,000. All units are self-contained and presented in good condition. At the front of the property there is a small railed garden with pathway leading to the hall door and to the rear there is a small patio with pedestrian access to a rear enclosed lane. \n\nThe property has appeal as an investment due to the strong rental income and high demand for the area. An ideal low maintenance investment and ready to go with 3 good tenancies. \n\nPhibsboro is a busy and established neighbourhood, an ideal location for business and living with many eateries, cafes, schools, and transport links.\n\n\nTotal Floor Area: 144m2 (1,550 sq. ft.) Approx. \n \nGROUND FLOOR:\n\nEntrance Hallway\n\nFlat 1\n\nOne bedroom self-contained flat c.28m2 ~ BER G & BER Number 103043105\n \nKitchen / Living Room, Bedroom & Shower Room \n\n\nFIRST FLOOR: \n\nFlat 2\n\nTwo bedroom self-contained flat c.41m2 ~ BER F & BER Number 103043089\n \nKitchen / Living Room, 2 Bedrooms & Shower Room \n\nSECOND FLOOR: \n\nFlat 3\n\nTwo bedroom self-contained flat c.39m2 ~ BER G & BER Number 103043071\n \nKitchen / Living Room, 2 Bedrooms & Shower Room \n\n\nOUTSIDE: \nSmall, railed garden area to the front. Yard to the rear with rear pedestrian access to a laneway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Located 5 minutes` walk from Phibsboro Village </li><li> Strong rental area - approximately 62,000 per annum </li><li> On-street resident disc parking </li><li> Attractive red brick period house </li><li> Divided into three self-contained residential units </li><li> All individually metered </li><li> Electric central heating</li></ul>"
      },
